---
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
import { contactEmail } from "../config";
---
<Site title="Our standards" description="The public promises behind PictureThis Production: safeguarding, consent, a free program, how to raise a concern and how we handle what you send us.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Policies" title="Our standards"/>
  <section class="page-opening"><p>These lines are public promises. The full policies sit behind them and are available to funders, partners and families on request.</p></section>
  <section>
    <ul>
      <li>Every mentor passes a Vulnerable Sector Check before working with participants and follows a written code of conduct.</li>
      <li>Mentors and participants meet in crew spaces, never alone off-site.</li>
      <li>Participants aged 16 and 17 join with a parent or guardian's consent, and a parent or guardian can reach the program lead at any time.</li>
      <li>Photos and recordings of participants are used only with consent, and consent can be withdrawn.</li>
      <li>The program is free, and it stays free. No fees, no gear purchases, no paid upsells.</li>
      <li>Anyone can raise a concern, about safety, conduct or anything else, and it will be heard by a named person, not a form. Email <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}?subject=Concern`}>{contactEmail}</a> and the program lead will reply to you personally.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section id="privacy" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
    <h2 id="privacy-title">What you send us</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>When you use a form on this site, your name, email address and choices are delivered to our inbox by Resend, an email delivery service, which also sends you a confirmation. We use them only to reply to you.</li>
      <li>This site takes no payments and never asks for card or banking details.</li>
      <li>To see or delete what you have sent us, email <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}?subject=My%20details`}>{contactEmail}</a>.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Site>
